---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Orphus"
  description="orphus.dev is a static site: no accounts, no cookies, no analytics, no third-party requests. This page is the entire privacy notice."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="label"><span class="comment">// legal/privacy</span></span>
      <span class="label hint">the whole notice — it is short because there is nothing to disclose</span>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <p>
        orphus.dev is a static website. It has no accounts, sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and
        loads nothing from third parties — fonts are served from this domain. We do not collect,
        store, or process any personal data, so there is nothing to consent to and no banner to
        dismiss.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare's infrastructure
        processes standard connection data (IP address, user agent) to serve requests and protect
        against abuse — see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a> for how
        they handle it. We do not receive or retain that data.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outbound links — GitHub for the source code and documentation, kelvinlee.io in the footer —
        take you to sites with their own privacy practices.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions about this notice or the
        project: <a href="https://github.com/kelvincushman/orphus/issues">open an issue on GitHub</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="dim mono updated">Last updated 26 August 2026 · applies to orphus.dev only</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { padding: 48px 0 80px; }
  .updated { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 40px; }
</style>
